  message: "Discovered during notes-vs-tracker consistency check on 2026-05-27. Three mutations lost from the 2026-05-26 session: WI-dilab-hitub (entire item, recreated as WI-pusuk), WI-hupaz done transition (re-applied manually), INV-hujog pending_validation (survived because it was written after cleanup). Root cause confirmed via transcript forensics: sync.py cleanup at lines 1486-1527 deleted untracked ops and reset tracked ops between the git-add snapshot and the ff-only merge."  # d376
